  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TEI Ethiopia: Improved Capacity on Reintegration of Returnees</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TEI Ethiopia: Improved Capacity on Reintegration of Returnees</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Interventionen bidrar till ett Team Europe-initiativ via EU-delegationen i Addis Abeba. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att fr&#xe4;mja v&#xe4;rdig och h&#xe5;llbar &#xe5;terintegrering av &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande migranter genom b&#xe4;ttre f&#xf6;rberedelser, st&#xe4;rkta nationella system, ekonomiska m&#xf6;jligheter och &#xf6;kat samh&#xe4;llsengagemang. Migranter som &#xe5;terv&#xe4;nder fr&#xe5;n bland annat EU och Gulfstaterna ska ges st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r s&#xe4;ker migration, v&#xe4;rdigt &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande och h&#xe5;llbar &#xe5;terintegrering, med s&#xe4;rskilt fokus p&#xe5; h&#xe4;lsofr&#xe4;mjande insatser. Nationella och lokala system ska utvecklas f&#xf6;r att gradvis ta &#xf6;ver ansvaret, medan s&#xe5;rbara &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande och v&#xe4;rdsamh&#xe4;llen f&#xe5;r tillg&#xe5;ng till inkluderande ekonomiska m&#xf6;jligheter. Dessutom ska ungdomar i omr&#xe5;den med h&#xf6;g irregulj&#xe4;r migration f&#xe5; riktade insatser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention contributes to a Team Europe initiative through the EU Delegation in Addis Ababa. The aim is to promote dignified and sustainable reintegration of returning migrants through better preparation, strengthened national systems, economic opportunities and increased community engagement. Migrants returning from, among others, the EU and the Gulf States will be supported for safe migration, dignified return and sustainable reintegration, with a particular focus on health-promoting interventions. National and local systems will be developed to gradually take over responsibility, while vulnerable returnees and host communities will have access to inclusive economic opportunities. In addition, young people in areas with high irregular migration will receive targeted interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
